; CupX demo screen text. Lines that start with a semicolon are comments.
;
;   # Heading      larger text in Cuphead gold
;   plain line     body text, wrapped and centred
;   (empty line)   paragraph gap
;   @duration 15   seconds on screen, 5 to 120
;
; The font has A-Z, a-z, 0-9, space, and  ! ' , - . : ; ?
; Straight and curly double quotes print as '. Other symbols print as a gap.
; If the text is taller than the text area, it scrolls during the hold.

@duration 25

# CupX
A Cuphead technical demo by Darkone83.

# About the project
An in-progress native RXDK build that runs Cuphead's own assets, repacked into CUPX volumes and streamed from the HDD. This demo covers the intro book, Elder Kettle's house, and the tutorial.

# Sources
Cuphead is copyright StudioMDHR Entertainment. All art, music, and characters belong to them.
Runtime built with RXDK.

# Thanks
Team Resurgent and everyone testing on real hardware.
